  "title": "Utah Broadband Appoints Ben Elkins as New CEO",
  "summary": "Arizona’s AireBeam CEO to Work in Both Capacities Draper, UT – May 15, 2024 – Utah Broadband (UBB), Utah’s most trusted high-speed Internet provider and a subsidiary of Boston Omaha Corporation (NYSE: BOC), announced today the appointment of Ben Elkins as its new CEO, following the retirement of Taunya Martin, former president of Utah Broadband. […]",
